  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Perk behavior changes depending on the <link enemy rank [#CombatantClassifications] /> of the target you're shooting.\n\nAgainst Minor and Elite Combatants: \nShots explode on hit, dealing up to 6.5 (32.5 on Shotgun) additional damage in a 3? meter radius. Explosions inherit the weapon's <link Combatant Damage Scaling [#CombatantScaling] />.\n\nTrace Rifle-specific: only every 4th Hit explodes.\n\nAgainst Minibosses and Bosses:\nExhausts for 5 seconds on hit.\n\nAgainst Players:\nGrants ?% Flinch Resistance for ? seconds.",
      "updatedAt": "2025-07-25T20:02:47.541Z",
      "updatedBy": "Stardust"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
